Description: Fetches public spatial data and field files and saves them to disk.
    Sources include arbitrary URLs read through GDAL virtual filesystems, the BC
    Data Catalogue, and GeoServer WFS endpoints. Also reads GPX files, converts and
    inspects GeoPackage layers, and backs up field data files.
